(6) The following two library functions are used in the program. 
(i) 
int strcmp(const char* s1, const char* s2) 
This function compares the string pointed by s1 and the string pointed by s2.  
When s1 < s2, it returns a negative value; when s1 = s2, it returns 0; when s1 > 
s2, it returns a positive value. 
(ii) char* strcpy(char* s1, const char* s2) 
This function copies  the string pointed by s2 (including the null character) to the 
